# Local-only data and secrets — never part of a Vercel build or deployment.
# (Static assets in static/ are NOT listed here: Vercel's build needs them to
# run collectstatic. staticfiles/ — the *output* of collectstatic — is
# regenerated on every build, so it's excluded the same way it's gitignored.)

db.sqlite3
staticfiles/
media/
private_media/
.env
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local dev / editor / CI cruft that has no reason to reach the build.
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.md
